<title>BELGIUM: Brussels bourse suspends Eurotunnel.</title>
<headline>Brussels bourse suspends Eurotunnel.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Brussels Stock Exchange said on Thursday it had suspended shares in Eurotunnel in line with a decision taken by the Paris bourse.</p>
<p>The Paris bourse said earlier the shares were suspended pending a statement from the company.</p>
<p>In London, the company said it had requested its shares to be suspended in London, Paris and Brussels. Shareholders are due to vote in Paris later on Thursday on the company's debt restructuring plan.</p>
<p>The Brussels bourse said shares would probably resume trade on Friday.</p>
